# warproxxx/poly_data snapshot directory
#
# Add the submodule then run the snapshot download:
#   git submodule add https://github.com/warproxxx/poly_data data/external/poly_data
#   cd data/external/poly_data && python download_snapshot.py
#
# Expected layout after download:
#   data/external/poly_data/
#     markets/           — markets.csv  (condition_id, question, end_date, …)
#     order_events/      — {condition_id}.csv  (ts, side, price, size, …)
#     trades/            — {condition_id}.csv  (ts, price, size, maker_side, …)
